# System packages this repo needs to BUILD on a Debian-family box.
# One apt package per line; `#` comments and blank lines ignored.
#
# The fleet build-box installer reads this file from every cloned repo and installs the union.
# It lives here rather than in the installer because it is a fact about this repo: when a
# dependency changes, the repo that changed it is the one that knows.

# bindgen runs clang over the HIP header and needs clang's own builtin headers (stddef.h).
clang
libclang-dev

# WARNING: these are NOT sufficient on their own. Ubuntu 24.04 ships ROCm 5.7, and
# crates/hipcore/build.rs aliases the ROCm 6 ABI symbols (hipDeviceProp_tR0600,
# hipGetDevicePropertiesR0600) which do not exist in 5.7 — the build script succeeds and the
# crate then fails to compile with unresolved-import errors that look like a code defect.
# A full workspace build needs ROCm 6.x from AMD's own apt repository.
#
# Compiling needs the headers and shared object only; running GPU code needs the hardware.
# A box with no AMD GPU can still gate this repo once ROCm 6 is installed.
libamdhip64-dev
libamdhip64-5
